sdrkit-usb 1
# A dongle with the generic strings Realtek / RTL2838UHIDIR (a Nooelec NESDR Nano 3, R820T2) at USB port 00-1.1,
# recorded by examples/rtl_check.rs record: open at 104.9 MHz, 2.4 MS/s, tuner AGC, 480 000 samples read, stop. Bulk
# payloads are cut to 16 bytes with their length and CRC; the serial numbers are replaced.
